      "type": "chat",
      "name": "skill_check",
      "text": "<f> I carefully inspect the fixed face of March Start Marker for a subtle mason's alignment mark. This is one unopposed Perception check at Medium difficulty; I do not touch, alter, take, move, attack, or do anything else. Whether I notice a mark or not, this observation alone changes no game entity.",
      "travel": false,
      "interactive": {
        "roll": 20,
        "questAccepted": false,
        "confirmed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
